ns\">山顶是平的。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">大陸</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たいりく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">大陆；洲；亚洲大陆（尤指中国大陆）；欧洲大陆</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"230381\">アフリカは<ruby>大陸<rp>(</rp><rt>たいりく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>であるが、グリーンランドはそうではない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">非洲是一个大陆, 而格陵兰不是。 <a class=\"ex-attribution\" href=\"https://tatoeba.org/sentences/show/766465\" title=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" aria-label=\"Tatoeba · Martha\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">↗</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">倒す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">たおす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">推倒；击倒；砍倒；放倒；使侧卧；使倾斜；杀死；打败；击败；推翻；绊倒；毁坏；拖欠；欺骗；彻底做；充分做；尽力做</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"170837\"><ruby>座席<rp>(</rp><rt>ざせき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>背<rp>(</rp><rt>せ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>倒<rp>(</rp><rt>たお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してもいいですか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我能把座位放回去吗?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">タオル</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">毛巾</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"203850\">タオルは<ruby>全<rp>(</rp><rt>まった</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>く<ruby>役<rp>(</rp><rt>やく</rt><rp>)</r